    "$$\n\\frac{\\partial\\ell}{\\partial\\eta}\n=-\\frac{n\\beta}{\\eta}\n+\\frac{\\beta}{\\eta^{\\beta+1}}\\sum_i d_i^\\beta=0\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\hat\\eta(\\beta,\\gamma)\n=\\left[\\frac1n\\sum_i d_i^\\beta\\right]^{1/\\beta}.\n\\tag{12}\n$$",
